          "Hadith.1888 - Muhammad ibn al-Nu'man narrated from Imam (as) that he was asked about a man who broke his fast for one day in the Month of Ramadan.\nImam (as) said: \"His expiation is two jars (jariban) of food, which is equivalent to twenty sa'.\""
